@host = http://localhost:5080

### New synthetic claim; repeat unchanged to demonstrate idempotency
POST {{host}}/api/claims
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: sample-claim-001

{
  "source": "sample-client",
  "externalClaimId": "DEMO-001",
  "memberId": "SYN-1001",
  "serviceDate": "2026-09-01",
  "amount": 250.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "scenario": "Transient"
}

### Latest 200 claims
GET {{host}}/api/claims

### Replace claim-id with the returned claim identifier
GET {{host}}/api/claims/claim-id

### Only dead-letter claims can be replayed
POST {{host}}/api/claims/claim-id/replay
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason":"Investigated simulated gateway failure; replay for demonstration"}
